  "title": "Add Chat Photos to Board"
 },
 "description": "Use this when the user attaches images in this chat and wants them in Uwear, on the Shoot Board or in a shoot: clothing, a Model, a Location or a reference. Put each attachment in its own field, image_file_1, image_file_2, ... in attachment order, as the chat provides it: ChatGPT passes the file itself, also when you see only a file name or path. Chat attachments only: a web address is refused (ask the user to attach that photo). kinds: {image_file_N: garment|avatar|location|reference} for photos whose kind the user said or is clear (avatar: a person to use as a Model); Uwear sorts the rest. Saves each photo to the library (a repeat is reused), adds it to the board and returns its pile and asset id for propose_brief / update_brief. A photo returned unsure lists two candidates: ask the user and call again with the same files and kinds.",
